                {
                  "text": "Questions",
                  "highlight": true
                }
              ],
              "description": "Quick answers to the questions we hear most often. If you cannot find what you are looking for, our team is happy to help.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "question": "What services does AdSphere offer?",
                  "answer": "We offer digital advertising, social media marketing, brand strategy, performance marketing, creative design, consulting, media planning and campaign management."
                },
                {
                  "question": "How do I get started with a project?",
                  "answer": "Fill in the Get a Quote form or contact us directly. We will set up a short call to understand your goals and then share a plan with timeline and pricing."
                },
                {
                  "question": "How much do your services cost?",
                  "answer": "Pricing depends on the scope, channels and duration of your project. After understanding your requirements we share a clear, customized quote with no hidden charges."
                },
                {
                  "question": "How long does it take to see results?",
                  "answer": "Paid campaigns can show early results within a few weeks, while SEO and brand building usually take a few months. We set realistic expectations before we begin."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Do you work with small businesses and startups?",
                  "answer": "Yes. We work with businesses of every size and shape the strategy and budget to match your stage of growth."
                },
                {
                  "question": "How will I know how my campaigns are performing?",
                  "answer": "You receive regular reports with the numbers that matter, along with clear insights and the next steps we recommend."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Can I change the plan after the project starts?",
                  "answer": "Yes. Marketing needs change, so we review the plan with you regularly and adjust channels, budgets or creatives when needed."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Is there a long-term contract?",
                  "answer": "We offer both project-based and ongoing engagements. The terms are agreed with you before the work begins."
                }
              ],
